<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Letter of Invitation</title>


  <style>
    @import url(https://themes.googleusercontent.com/fonts/css?kit=EvgJ7Z5YUOHIVa7FzreBtnJaCXbUNpokFT14knn5_IiZgmkfx1rGQi3tdwEbyL6S);
    @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
    html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    .page {
      position: relative;
      width: 210mm;
      height: 297mm;
      background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,');
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-size: 100% 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .content {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 50mm 20mm 60mm 20mm; /* top right bottom left: regola per centrare il testo */
      color: #000;
    }

    h2 {
      font-weight:400;
      font-size:17pt;
      font-family:"Francois One";
      line-height: 1.1 !important;
      margin: 0 0 16pt !important;
    }

    .c1{font-weight:400;font-size:11pt;font-family:"Lato"}
    .c2{font-style:normal}
    .c3{font-style:italic}
    .c5{line-height:1.5;text-align:left;font-size:11pt;font-family:"Lato"}
    .c7{line-height:1.0;text-align:justify}
    .c8{font-weight:400;font-size:17pt;font-family:"Lato"}
    .c12{line-height:1.15;text-align:left;height:11pt}
    .c15{line-height:1.0;text-align:justify}
    .c16{line-height:1.15;text-align:right}
    .c21{padding-bottom:11.2pt;line-height:1.5;text-align:justify}

    .content p { margin: 0 0 12pt; }   /* aumenta/diminuisci 12pt a piacere */
    .content h2 { margin: 0 0 16pt; }
    .content p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }  /* opzionale: niente spazio sull’ultimo */
    img, header, footer { display: none !important; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="content">

      <p class="c16"><span class="c1">{{issueDate}}</span></p>
      <h2 class="c0"><span>Letter of Invitation</span></h2>

      <p class="c15"><span class="c1">Dear {{firstName}} {{lastName}},</span></p>

      <p class="c15">
        <span class="c1">On behalf of ESN International and the Organising Committee, we would like to invite you to attend the </span>
        <span class="c1">Erasmus Generation Meeting </span>
        <span class="c1">event of Erasmus Student Network in </span>
        <span class="c1">Split, Croatia</span>
        <span class="c1">, between the </span>
        <span class="c1">16th and 20th of April 2026.</span>
        <span class="c2 c1"> Erasmus Student Network (ESN) is one of the biggest interdisciplinary student associations in Europe, founded in 1989 to support and develop student exchanges, especially within the framework of the Erasmus programme.</span>
      </p>

      <p class="c15">
        <span class="c2 c1"> The Erasmus Generation Meeting (EGM) is the biggest student-led conference in Europe, dedicated to the mobility and internationalisation of education.</span>
      </p>

      <p class="c15">
        <span class="c1">In 2026, the theme of the event - </span>
        <span class="c1 c3">Shaping Skills through Student Mobility</span>
        <span class="c1">, is supported by the two pillars of </span>
        <span class="c1 c3">Development of Competences through Volunteering and Student-led Mobility</span>
        <span class="c1">, and </span>
        <span class="c1 c3">Impact and Recognition of Student Engagement</span>
        <span class="c1">. The aim of the conference is to empower young people to let their voices be heard and influence key stakeholders in international mobility, driving impactful changes and improvements across the different mobility programmes in higher education.</span>
      </p>

      <p class="c15">
        <span class="c2 c1">We acknowledge that your ID/passport details are as follows:</span><br><br>
        <span class="c1" style="margin-left: 2.75em;">Date of Birth: </span><span class="c2 c1">{{dateOfBirth}}</span><br>
        <span class="c1" style="margin-left: 2.75em;">Place of Birth: </span><span class="c2 c1">{{placeOfBirth}}</span><br>
        <span class="c1" style="margin-left: 2.75em;">ID/Passport Number: </span><span class="c2 c1">{{passportNumber}}</span><br>
        <span class="c1" style="margin-left: 2.75em;">ID/Passport Issue Date: </span><span class="c2 c1">{{passportIssueDate}}</span><br>
        <span class="c1" style="margin-left: 2.75em;">ID/Passport Expiry Date: </span><span class="c2 c1">{{passportExpiryDate}}</span>
      </p>

      <p class="c15">
        <span class="c1">If you need more information or details about the meeting or have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us via </span>
        <span class="c1">secretariat@esn.org,</span>
        <span class="c1"> or +32 470 50 60 02, or +385 98 131 1468.</span>
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>